// === ELEMENT SPEC ===
// C atom → SphereGeometry(0.32) MeshStandardMaterial grey #888888
// Nu atom → SphereGeometry(0.42) MeshStandardMaterial color by charge
// X atom → SphereGeometry(0.42) MeshStandardMaterial color by charge
